WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier, 
and here is another update vlog.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.280
It is a beautiful day outside,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.420
The sun is shining, the birds are chirping,

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.260
and I got to go on a nice walk with Chica this morning.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.780
And it was just lovely, 
and I wanted to make a video to announce that

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.160
I am not retiring in any way, shape or form.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.380
I'm not going anywhere!

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.740
I love making videos for you guys,
and I can't wait to keep doing them

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.880
for the foreseeable future and never stopping.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.700
So thank you guys so much for watching,

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.200
And as always,

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.760
I will see you

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:28.620
in the next video.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.020
BUH BYEEAH!

